{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"8e29b3b3-eb8c-4755-aaec-d317609f4f19":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/star-rating\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"link_GReDtT":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.link_to_title.value }}"}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"only_tier_gang_button":"Required gang tier not reached","set_size":3,"set_text":"Wähle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/account\/login"}},"se_wishlist_engine_product_page_bNq4WD":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/se-wishlist-engine\/blocks\/Product-Page\/8f7c0857-8e71-463d-a168-8e133094753b","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"6d5b98cf-5085-441e-8662-08829574072f":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/klarna-on-site-messaging\/blocks\/app-block\/b95936a9-74b6-4a95-8103-6a1b6459c25e","settings":{"data_key":"credit-promotion-badge","theme":"light","topPadding":"0","bottomPadding":"0","messagePrefix":""}},"recommended_products_J7YJdN":{"type":"recommended_products","settings":{"title":"Discover other flavours","content":"","button_text":"Add all to cart!","product_list":["vanilla-cream","tough-nut-cream"],"enable_bulk_add":false,"columns_desktop":"2","enable_desktop_slider":false,"columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":false}},"48d855be-02b0-42cb-b1aa-11ebf188e680":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Description","icon":"clipboard","content":"<p>Cookie evokes the flavour of biscuits fresh from the bakery - only without the crumbs, and with added kick. With fine notes of vanilla and caramel, this delicious, premium Moonshine liqueur makes the perfect sweet treat or winter warmer.<\/p><p>Reminisce on memories of childhood with a flavour that replicates the taste of a classic sweet treat. Our Cookie Moonshine contains only the best ingredients and (unlike most cookies) contains zero allergens. Enjoy on its own or find recipes on our <a href=\"\/blogs\/cocktails\" title=\"Cocktails\">cocktails page<\/a>.<\/p><p>Bottled in traditional Mason Jars, we promise a unique drinking experience. If you would like to discover <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">more high quality liqueurs, have<\/a> a look at our entire product range and become part of our <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">Moonshine Gang<\/a> to collect proof points and get unique benefits.<\/p><p>For those new to Moonshine: it was an illegal grain alcohol distilled during the era of the American Prohibition, bottled in traditional Mason Jars to avoid the suspicion of the authorities. O’Donnell Moonshine brings just a hint of that infamous epoch to a new generation. So, discover your rebel spirit!<\/p><h5>*Consult our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/faq\">FAQ's<\/a> for more information.<\/h5>","page":""}},"9a2b3e45-f359-4ba0-8c79-ef44508bd996":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Moonshine Must-Haves","icon":"check_mark","content":"<p>1. Your jar of <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">Moonshine<\/a>.<\/p><p>2. Our reusable <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/pouring-lid\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/pouring-lid\">Pouring Lid<\/a> so you don't waste a drop!<\/p>","page":""}},"063a61aa-b0cf-40db-b4ee-c4a5b4a059e9":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<h3>Cookies & Cream<\/h3><ul><li>25ml Cookie Moonshine<\/li><li>Whipped Cream\/Oat Cream or 25ml O'Donnell Vanilla Cream <\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>Recipe<\/h3><p>To a shot glass add your Cookie Moonshine liqueur and top with whipped cream. Alternatively, top your shot with vanilla cream liqueur!<\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p><p>You can find more recipes on our <a href=\"\/blogs\/cocktails\" title=\"Cocktails\">cocktail blog<\/a>.<\/p>","page":""}},"e8252ae0-3a33-4d7a-9d7f-da64243dc21c":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"63862bed-9fe1-47b7-b12a-4672ab58aa9f":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. All of our products are suitable for those with a gluten intolerance.<\/p><p>All products, unless stated otherwise, are vegan.<\/p><p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<\/p>","page":""}},"b56c0c73-b462-4d8b-9198-82261fb73e39":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["title","caption","8e29b3b3-eb8c-4755-aaec-d317609f4f19","price","description","variant_picker","quantity_selector","link_GReDtT","buy_buttons","se_wishlist_engine_product_page_bNq4WD","6d5b98cf-5085-441e-8662-08829574072f","recommended_products_J7YJdN","48d855be-02b0-42cb-b1aa-11ebf188e680","9a2b3e45-f359-4ba0-8c79-ef44508bd996","063a61aa-b0cf-40db-b4ee-c4a5b4a059e9","e8252ae0-3a33-4d7a-9d7f-da64243dc21c","63862bed-9fe1-47b7-b12a-4672ab58aa9f","b56c0c73-b462-4d8b-9198-82261fb73e39"],"settings":{"gift_card_receipient_enabled":false,"is_above_the_fold":true,"enable_sticky_info":true,"badges_enabled":false,"gallery_layout":"thumbnail","media_size":"small","mobile_thumbnails":"hide","hide_variants":true,"enable_video_looping":false,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"210638d2-97dd-4ed8-b107-23aafc6fd4b9":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16351031427203__210638d2-97dd-4ed8-b107-23aafc6fd4b9-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Sweet & Delicious","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16351031427203__210638d2-97dd-4ed8-b107-23aafc6fd4b9-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>With fine notes of vanilla , chocolate and caramel, complimented by our smooth, premium Moonshine, O'Donnell Cookie is the perfect treat for any sweet tooth.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16351031427203__210638d2-97dd-4ed8-b107-23aafc6fd4b9-heading-1","template--16351031427203__210638d2-97dd-4ed8-b107-23aafc6fd4b9-text-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/CookieMood_UK.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"246736d7-53ff-422b-8601-1dc1f206a7b4":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16351031427203__246736d7-53ff-422b-8601-1dc1f206a7b4-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Discover More Flavours!","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16351031427203__246736d7-53ff-422b-8601-1dc1f206a7b4-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Our Cookie Moonshine offers a wonderful winter warmer, but that's far from where the Moonshine fun stops. Discover our full range of over 20 flavours and find your new favourite today!<\/p>","text_style":"body"}},"template--16351031427203__246736d7-53ff-422b-8601-1dc1f206a7b4-button-1":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"All Flavours","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/moonshine","button_style_white_color":false}}},"block_order":["template--16351031427203__246736d7-53ff-422b-8601-1dc1f206a7b4-heading-1","template--16351031427203__246736d7-53ff-422b-8601-1dc1f206a7b4-text-1","template--16351031427203__246736d7-53ff-422b-8601-1dc1f206a7b4-button-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Cookie_Coktail_UK.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":12,"padding_bottom":12}},"33941052-6e07-491f-ad0a-944a4999deab":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16351031427203__33941052-6e07-491f-ad0a-944a4999deab-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Looking  For a Gift?","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16351031427203__33941052-6e07-491f-ad0a-944a4999deab-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>All our flavours are also available as part of one of our Giftboxes. Including two jars of Moonshine, 2 shot glasses and a Pouring Lid, these contain everything you need for the perfect gift!<\/p>","text_style":"body"}},"template--16351031427203__33941052-6e07-491f-ad0a-944a4999deab-button-1":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Shop Giftboxes","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/giftbox","button_style_white_color":fal